      "rationale": "One sampled item instructs 'Use coins and bills to make exactly ₱90. Use the fewest pieces possible.' and then offers 100, 85, 90 and 110 as choices with 90 as the key. The correct option is stated verbatim in the stem, so the item cannot assess determining a value; it asks the student to repeat a number they have just been given."
    },
    "comprehensive_coverage": {
